{"id":173,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"人間力を育てる奈良学園中高一貫","feature_description":"奈良学園中学校・高等学校は、中高6年一貫の共学進学校として、学力・自主性・協調性・体力をバランスよく育てる『人間力』を教育の中心に据えています。SSHとして課題研究にも取り組み、深く考える習慣と探究心を養う構成です。豊かな自然環境のなかで、部活動も積極的に推進しています。生徒主体の学校行事や探究の積み重ねが、進路実現を支えています。課題研究と行事が連動し、主体的な学びを後押しします。","clubs":[{"id":3066,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3067,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3068,"name":"中学テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3069,"name":"高校テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3070,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3071,"name":"アーチェリー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3072,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3073,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3074,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3075,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3076,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3077,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3078,"name":"水泳同好会","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3079,"name":"囲碁将棋部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.ed.jp